│     "title": "Benzodiazepine use, abuse, and dependence",                                                            │
│     "abstract": "Although benzodiazepines are invaluable in the treatment of anxiety disorders, they have some       │
│ potential for abuse and may cause dependence or addiction. It is important to distinguish between addiction to and   │
│ normal physical dependence on benzodiazepines. Intentional abusers of benzodiazepines usually have other substance   │
